想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"content": "不道呀。我只知道美伊战争，美元指数上升，黄金跌了，同时各国抛一点点黄金换流动性。只要通胀过高，加息越多，但加息赶不上通胀，黄金会被动上涨；通胀很小的话，很快就会降息，黄金更会涨。两条路黄金都会涨，时间不同，看美国国情了", "reviewId": "72617155_88x5FXxn6", "commentId": "72617155_88x5FXxn6_c392450497_88HawE9xi", "userVid": 392450497, "createTime": 1777345816, "author": {"userVid": 392450497, "name": "为你捧花", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/GicWz2e0SPzZdSYov4VOe6LhJxciaR9O5K6wjsjeqJGibzdejnAZCR38Uvg1sW350gnyUrKcqL8Rg0PUvt8iaWKvSliaAK1n0KwsI6Fo9HtkibHzA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "为你捧花", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-10", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作爱好者", "levelIndex": 10}}}], "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1780974334}